⚠️ Overlay order matters – later overlays see results of earlier ones
⚠️ NEVER modify prev directly – always return new attrset (`final: prev: { ... }`)
⚠️ Use `overrideAttrs` for simple changes; `callPackage` for complex packages
⚠️ Overlays compose – stack multiple overlays for layered customization
⚠️ Nixpkgs 25.11 includes 150+ community overlays in nixpkgs-overlays repo [[11]]

