⚠️ Distroless images have NO SHELL – debugging requires `docker exec` with external tools
⚠️ Always include glibc for dynamically linked binaries (or use static compilation)
⚠️ `created = "1970-01-01..."` ensures reproducible image metadata (critical for SBOMs)
